   - [ ] Animated number counters use `data-count` where stats exist?
   - [ ] Semantic HTML: `<main>`, `<section>`, `<header>`, `<article>`?
   - [ ] All charts have explicit container sizing (≥300px height)?
   - [ ] Hero/title text visible on both themes?
